# The device plugins that travel inside the app, one directory per platform,
# are build output and never source. The plugins themselves are in plugins/ at
# the top of the repository; what lands here is a built copy of three of them:
#
#   dev/bundle-plugins.sh
#
# tauri.conf.json lists plugins/ under bundle.resources, so whatever is here
# when `cargo tauri build` runs goes inside the app, and the shell seeds it
# into the application data directory at launch. With nothing here the app
# leaves the mixer's own plugins directory alone, which is how a developer
# build and a bare `godwinmix` keep working.
macos/
windows/
linux/
!.gitignore
